a"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1881606, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14buu.jpg"}, {"id": 1881607, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14buv.jpg"}, {"id": 1881608, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14buw.jpg"}, {"id": 1881609, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14bux.jpg"}, {"id": 1881604, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14bus.jpg"}, {"id": 1881605, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14but.jpg"}], "slug": "morimens", "storyline": "The world is dying, yet its inhabitants remain blissfully unaware.\n\nConfronted with a creeping, unspeakable calamity, you shall take on the role of Keeper, awakening powers intertwined with the very doom threatening existence. You will link yourself with sentient weapons teetering on the brink of madness, to withstand this monumental crisis.\n\nIf all is destined to be forgotten, would you bear the burden of secrets as testament to the world's existence, forging ahead into the unknown?\n\nLet these tombstones bear witness, and may the Silver Key light our way.\n\nWelcome to Mythag University, Keeper.", "summary": "Morimens is a roguelite card-battling game set in a world inspired by the Lovecratian mythos. Something is wrong with Kadath. Bond with hauntingly beautiful Awakeners, build a deck from the remnants of their power, and push deeper into the mist\u2014where the events get stranger, the cards get darker, and the truth is something you may not survive knowing.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/morimens", "videos": [{"id": 153869, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "CGHXSPDO2zQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CGHXSPDO2zQ", "title": "\u300a\u5fd8\u537b\u524d\u591c\u300b| \u559a\u9192\u7981\u5fcc\u5b58\u5728\uff0c\u5c0d\u6297\u672a\u77e5\u707d\u5384\uff0d\u6b61\u8fce\u5165\u5b78\uff0c\u5b88\u5bc6\u4eba", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CGHXSPDO2zQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 190572, "name": "Cinematic Trailer", "video_id": "Z7AWj87O6Fc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7AWj87O6Fc", "title": "\ud83c\udfac Morimens \u00d7 Saya no Uta\u4e28V2.5.1 PV - Song of Perennial Wandering (VA: Midori Kawamura)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Z7AWj87O6Fc/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 190573, "name": "Cinematic Trailer", "video_id": "NLLf3DhYbws", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NLLf3DhYbws", "title": "\ud83c\udfac Morimens\u4e28V2.5 PV - Web of the Moirai (VA: \u014cnishi Saori)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NLLf3DhYbws/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 190891, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "Dd6TUUYBcWU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dd6TUUYBcWU", "title": "\u300aMorimens\u300b Introduction Video", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Dd6TUUYBcWU/sddefault.jpg"}]}